· | results of our clinical trials and preclinical studies, and the results of trials of our competitors or those of other companies in our market sector;

· | our ability to obtain and maintain regulatory approval of elraglusib or any future product candidates or additional indications thereof, or limitations to specific label indications or patient populations for its use, or changes or delays in the regulatory review process;

